WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.800
Your life is already full of stories.

2
00:00:02.920 --> 00:00:05.095
The trick is finding them again.

3
00:00:05.215 --> 00:00:09.515
Alcove Home brings personal search
to the records you already have.

4
00:00:12.300 --> 00:00:19.925
This is the question you actually sent: find the years we went
to the Renaissance Festival, and put the kids' pictures in order.

5
00:00:20.045 --> 00:00:21.745
Let's start there.

6
00:00:25.300 --> 00:00:29.725
Here are actual photographs from twenty
twenty-three and twenty twenty-four.

7
00:00:29.845 --> 00:00:38.895
The capture dates match messages about the outing, the parking, and finding
each other at the festival. Two visits, with the children growing between them.

8
00:00:39.015 --> 00:00:41.465
Missing years still need evidence.

9
00:00:44.300 --> 00:00:46.725
Then there is the dentist question.

10
00:00:46.845 --> 00:00:53.495
Two real clinic messages give us September sixteenth:
twelve thirty for John, one o'clock for Kateri.

11
00:00:53.615 --> 00:00:55.765
Those are scheduled appointments.

12
00:00:55.885 --> 00:01:01.310
The source tells us what it knows, without
pretending it proves the last completed visit.

13
00:01:02.300 --> 00:01:04.425
And the trail goes further back.

14
00:01:04.545 --> 00:01:08.370
In twenty sixteen, a friend asked how the festival was.

15
00:01:08.490 --> 00:01:11.690
Your reply: it was fun, the weather was perfect.

16
00:01:11.810 --> 00:01:15.435
A small message brings a forgotten visit back into view.

17
00:01:16.300 --> 00:01:19.000
This is the working Alcove search screen.

18
00:01:19.120 --> 00:01:29.170
Selected message records are now in the private demo collection. The browser finds the appointment evidence with its connection turned off, and lets you open the source.

19
00:01:32.300 --> 00:01:34.838
Your friends asked about old Zip disks.

20
00:01:34.952 --> 00:01:37.987
You asked for pictures of your father holding a child.

21
00:01:38.101 --> 00:01:40.378
Those remain questions to prove.

22
00:01:40.492 --> 00:01:44.500
The rule stays simple: find the
evidence before claiming the answer.

23
00:01:45.300 --> 00:01:51.850
Photos. Messages. The original records, unchanged. A
personal search engine should bring your stories closer.

24
00:01:53.300 --> 00:01:58.750
Alcove Home. Real records, useful answers,
and a little more of your life within reach.
